To the extent MAMUT-routing holds the relevant rights, the MAMUT-routing
curation artifacts in this directory are distributed under the MIT License in
the repository root.

This family curates time-dependent VRPTW benchmark material originating from
Solomon (1987), the time-dependent extension of Dabia et al. (2013) under the
Ichoua et al. (2003) travel-time model, and the instance distribution of
Lera-Romero et al. (2020). This license notice does not claim to relicense
third-party benchmark definitions or third-party best-known solution sources
beyond the rights held by MAMUT-routing contributors.
